      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792297368187,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Frosted Folder Fan: 3D perspective tilts with CSS transform on mouse movement.\n2. Clothesline Suspension: Elastic suspension cables with gravity tilt on project cards.\n3. Manila Dossier Deep-Dive: Expandable architectural tabs with real-time telemetry streams.\n4. Developer License Badge: Hologram shimmer, security microprint borders, and QR verification.\n5. Flight Log Journey: Desktop fanning timeline + Mobile horizontal touch-swipe carousel.\n6. Postal Mail Form: Interactive desk stationery with wax seal transmit interaction.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Frosted Folder Fan: 3D perspective tilts with CSS transform on mouse movement.\n2. Clothesline Suspension: Elastic suspension cables with gravity tilt on project cards.\n3. Manila Dossier Deep-Dive: Expandable architectural tabs with real-time telemetry streams.\n4. Developer License Badge: Hologram shimmer, security microprint borders, and QR verification.\n5. Flight Log Journey: Desktop fanning timeline + Mobile horizontal touch-swipe carousel.\n6. Postal Mail Form: Interactive desk stationery with wax seal transmit interaction.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
